# A line holding bytes that are not UTF-8 -- a stray continuation byte
# (0x91) followed by a combining mark (U+0360) -- opens and paints the
# stray byte as U+FFFD. It used to panic the renderer on the first frame.
write bad.txt "a\n‘Í z\nÿq\n"
open bad.txt
wait 100
expect screen contains "bad.txt"
